  "create_construction_site.configuration.title": "Construction Site Configs",
  "create_construction_site.configuration.collapseEnabled": "Dug material collapses",
  "create_construction_site.configuration.collapseEnabled.tooltip": "When a tool of this mod digs a block, the diggable blocks standing directly on top of it fall down. Off: they stay floating, as in plain Minecraft.",
  "create_construction_site.configuration.collapseMaxHeight": "Collapse height limit",
  "create_construction_site.configuration.collapseMaxHeight.tooltip": "How many blocks above one dug block fall down at most.",
  "create_construction_site.configuration.section.create_construction_site.common.toml": "Construction Site Configs",
  "create_construction_site.configuration.section.create_construction_site.common.toml.title": "Construction Site Configs",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_sizes.header": "Sizes and the Wrench",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_sizes.text_1": "Excavator Buckets dig loose material and carry it when a moving contraption pushes them into it",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_sizes.text_2": "A bucket is 1, 2 or 3 blocks high, and as deep as it is high",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_sizes.text_3": "Bucket blocks placed beside a bucket make it wider",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_sizes.text_4": "A bucket can be up to 3 blocks wide when 1 high, 5 when 2 high and 7 when 3 high",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_sizes.text_5": "Use a Wrench to move the mount: from the back, to hidden, to the top, and back again",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_digging.header": "Digging",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_digging.text_1": "On a moving contraption, such as this Gantry, an Excavator Bucket pushed open side first into loose material digs it",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_digging.text_2": "It takes the diggable blocks its opening and teeth reach, as long as it has room",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_digging.text_3": "Diggable blocks standing on a dug block come down",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_digging.text_4": "A bucket holds one block for each of its blocks, and shows its load inside",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_emptying.header": "Emptying",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_emptying.text_1": "On a moving contraption, an Excavator Bucket empties when it is tipped so its open side points down",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_emptying.text_2": "The load comes out as a stream, newest blocks first, falls, and lands as a heap",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_emptying.text_3": "A full bucket starts to spill at about 20 degrees; the last block leaves at about 45",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_rope.header": "Tying a Rope",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_rope.text_1": "Each block of a bucket's width takes one Create Aeronautics rope, tied to its middle tooth",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_rope.text_2": "The other end needs another rope holder, such as a Rope Connector, here placed on a log. A rope cannot be tied to a plain block",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_rope.text_3": "With it, an excavator can pull or lift things",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_simulated.header": "On Simulated Contraptions",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_simulated.text_1": "Excavator Buckets also work on Create Aeronautics' simulated contraptions, such as vehicles",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.excavator_bucket_simulated.text_2": "They dig, carry and empty the same way, by how the contraption moves them",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_sizes.header": "Sizes and the Wrench",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_sizes.text_1": "On a moving contraption, a Bulldozer Blade pushes the loose material in front of it",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_sizes.text_2": "Blade blocks placed on top of each other make a taller blade, up to 3 blocks high",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_sizes.text_3": "Blade blocks placed beside a blade make it wider",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_sizes.text_4": "A blade can be up to 9 blocks wide, whatever its height",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_sizes.text_5": "Use a Wrench to switch the mount on the back: arms in the middle, at the ends, or hidden",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_gaps.header": "Pushing a Pile and Filling Gaps",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_gaps.text_1": "On a moving contraption, such as this Gantry, a Bulldozer Blade pushes the loose material in front of it",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_gaps.text_2": "It takes diggable blocks such as dirt, sand and gravel, at its own height, and carries them as a pile",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_gaps.text_3": "Each block of width carries 1 block on a blade 1 high, 4 on a blade 2 high and 9 on a blade 3 high",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_gaps.text_4": "When the pile passes over a gap, blocks drop into it and fill it",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_gaps.text_5": "This is how a blade fills trenches and levels the ground",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_full.header": "When the Blade is Full, and Backing Away",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_full.text_1": "On a moving contraption, a Bulldozer Blade carries only as much as its pile can hold",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_full.text_2": "When the blade is full, it moves further blocks off its nearer end, where they form a ridge",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_full.text_3": "When the blade backs away, it leaves its pile on the ground as it was",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_simulated.header": "On Simulated Contraptions",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_simulated.text_1": "Bulldozer Blades also work on Create Aeronautics' simulated contraptions, such as vehicles",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.bulldozer_blade_simulated.text_2": "They push, fill gaps and leave their pile the same way, by how the contraption moves them",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.tag.construction_tools": "Construction Tools",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.tag.construction_tools.description": "Tools that dig, push, carry and tip material when a contraption moves them",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body": "Dump Body",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.summary": "_Carries_ loose material and _tips it out_. Place several together for a _bigger body_.",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.condition1": "When material falls in",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.behaviour1": "_Catches_ and _holds_ it, one block per Dump Body block.",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.condition2": "When tilted",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.behaviour2": "Empties over its lowest _open side_, or its _top_ when upside down.",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.condition3": "When Wrenched",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.behaviour3": "_Opens_ or _closes_ the clicked side. New ones are _closed_. _Sneak_ to pick up the _layer_ on that side.",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.condition4": "When placed on a Dump Body",
  "block.create_construction_site.dump_body.tooltip.behaviour4": "Adds a _whole layer_ at once. _Sneak_ for a single block.",
  "gui.goggles.create_construction_site.dump_body.title": "Dump Body:",
  "gui.goggles.create_construction_site.dump_body.fill": "%s of %s blocks",
  "gui.goggles.create_construction_site.dump_body.empty": "Empty",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_sizes.header": "Sizes and the Wrench",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_sizes.text_1": "A Dump Body carries loose material on a contraption and tips it out",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_sizes.text_2": "Dump Body blocks placed together join into one open-top box, up to 7 wide, 15 long and 4 high",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_sizes.text_3": "A Dump Body placed on a full side of one adds that whole layer at once. Sneak to place a single block",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_sizes.text_4": "Every block holds one block of material, so this one holds 30",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_sizes.text_5": "A new Dump Body is closed on all sides; each shows a locking bar",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_loading.header": "Loading",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_loading.text_1": "Material that falls into a Dump Body is stored in it, also when it stands on the ground",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_loading.text_2": "It is shown inside the body, never higher than its walls. In a deep body, material heaps and then spreads",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_loading.text_3": "Engineer's Goggles show how full it is and what it holds",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_tipping.header": "Tipping",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_tipping.text_1": "On a moving contraption, such as this Mechanical Bearing, a Dump Body empties when it is tilted",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_tipping.text_2": "With the low side closed, nothing comes out: the load only slides against the wall",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_tipping.text_3": "Use a Wrench to open that side into a tailgate",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_tipping.text_4": "Now the tailgate swings open, hanging straight down, and the load streams out from the low end",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_tipping.text_5": "A full body starts at about 20 degrees; the last blocks leave at about 45. The side that points down the most is the one that opens",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_simulated.header": "On Simulated Contraptions",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_simulated.text_1": "A Dump Body also works on Create Aeronautics' simulated contraptions. Here, as one example of many, a Swivel Bearing tips it, as on a dump truck",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_simulated.text_2": "On a simulated contraption it catches, holds and empties the same way: over its lowest open side",
  "create_construction_site.ponder.dump_body_sizes.text_6": "Use a Wrench on a side to make it a tailgate, which opens when the body is tipped toward it. Wrench it again to close it",
